    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Pony AI Inc. is an autonomous driving technology company that describes itself as pursuing a vision of safe, sustainable, and accessible mobility worldwide. It says it was founded in 2016 in Silicon Valley and now operates three business units: Robotaxi, Robotruck, and Personally Owned Vehicles (POV). Its core technology is what it calls a \"virtual driver,\" and the company says it has secured licenses and credentials to test and operate autonomous vehicles in multiple locations around the world.\n\nOn its own account, Pony.ai's vehicles had traveled over 32 million kilometers (over 13 million miles) on urban roads and highways as of April 2024, accumulated through road testing in complex scenarios including difficult weather and road conditions. The company presents this mileage as the groundwork for scalable autonomous driving products and services, and describes itself as an industry leader in commercializing autonomous driving.\n\nThe company is publicly traded under the ticker PONY and has a CIK number, 0001969302, on file with the SEC. Its headquarters are listed as Guangzhou.",
